=== intro

The jump drive shudders, then coughs, then screams. Warning lights cascade across the console. The Holdfast drops out of transit early, dead in space.

Diagnostic: primary drive coil failure. Without repairs, you're not going anywhere.

* [Emergency repairs with spare parts]
  ~ credits -= 40
  ~ chronicle "Emergency Repairs"
    Burned through spare parts fixing the jump drive. Expensive, but we're flying again.
  -> END

* [Let the engineer work their magic] { crew.engineering }
  ~ credits -= 15
  ~ chronicle "Field Repairs"
    The engineer coaxed the jump drive back to life with minimal parts. Skill saves credits.
  -> END

* [Broadcast a distress signal]
  ~ credits -= 60
  ~ morale -= 5
